call-transcripts/2026/11/06/affirm-afrm-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[3,2,1,3.17],"dtc":[5,2,3,5.28],"ai_spend":[0,0,0,0.0],"tariffs":[0,0,0,0.0],"pricing_power":[0,0,0,0.0],"cost_cuts":[0,0,0,0.0],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":-0.0223,"r5":-0.0548,"r1_spy":-0.0254,"r5_spy":-0.0877}}],"quotes":[{"c":"AFRM 2021 Q3","e":"afrm","d":"2021-05-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael Linford","x":"Reflecting on these dynamics, we are raising our outlook for the balance of the fiscal year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/11/affirm-holdings-inc-afrm-q3-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AFRM 2021 Q4","e":"afrm","d":"2021-09-09","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Michael Linford","x":"GMV growth came for both new and existing merchant relationships, as well as our direct-to-consumer virtual card product.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/09/17/affirm-holdings-inc-afrm-q4-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AFRM 2021 Q4","e":"afrm","d":"2021-09-09","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Michael Linford","x":"It was roughly consistent on a sequential basis and reflects our growth in our interest-bearing products, especially in the travel category, and our direct-to-consumer virtual card product.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/09/17/affirm-holdings-inc-afrm-q4-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AFRM 2021 Q4","e":"afrm","d":"2021-09-09","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Michael Linford","x":"But also we had our direct-to-consumer virtual card product, Affirm Anywhere, grow substantially.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/09/17/affirm-holdings-inc-afrm-q4-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AFRM 2022 Q1","e":"afrm","d":"2021-11-10","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Max Levchin","x":"You might catch it on social media while streaming TV and on billboards in several markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/11/affirm-holdings-inc-afrm-q1-2022-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AFRM 2022 Q1","e":"afrm","d":"2021-11-10","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Michael Linford","x":"In addition to helping our integrated merchant partners drive conversion, our direct-to-consumer virtual card product also delivered triple-digit growth, growing 119%, demonstrating strong adoption of our offerings, particularly among returning consumers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/11/affirm-holdings-inc-afrm-q1-2022-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AFRM 2022 Q1","e":"afrm","d":"2021-11-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael Linford","x":"Given our strategic progress and strong Q1 results, we have raised our outlook for GMV, revenue, and revenue less transaction costs for fiscal year '22, which I will discuss in detail in a moment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/11/affirm-holdings-inc-afrm-q1-2022-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AFRM 2022 Q1","e":"afrm","d":"2021-11-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael Linford","x":"Accordingly, we are raising our outlook for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/11/affirm-holdings-inc-afrm-q1-2022-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AFRM 2022 Q2","e":"afrm","d":"2022-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Max Levchin","x":"And fundamentally, just from going back to my experience 20-odd years ago, pricing power of a payments network is directly proportionate to the number of active users it has.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/11/affirm-holdings-inc-afrm-q2-2022-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AFRM 2022 Q2","e":"afrm","d":"2022-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Max Levchin","x":"And we, generally speaking, were able to command a significantly -- significant price increases at the merchant base during the early days of the pandemic because the products that we provide to the consumer in the moments of uncertainty is just so damn powerful.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/11/affirm-holdings-inc-afrm-q2-2022-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AFRM 2022 Q2","e":"afrm","d":"2022-02-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael Linford","x":"With the accelerating growth of our business and the early traction with our enterprise partners, we are raising our outlook for fiscal year '22, which I'll share more about in a moment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/11/affirm-holdings-inc-afrm-q2-2022-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AFRM 2022 Q2","e":"afrm","d":"2022-02-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael Linford","x":"We are reiterating our guidance and taking it up.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/11/affirm-holdings-inc-afrm-q2-2022-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AFRM 2022 Q3","e":"afrm","d":"2022-05-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Max Levchin","x":"So it's essential for us to continue launching direct-to-consumer payment products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/13/affirm-holdings-inc-afrm-q3-2022-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AFRM 2022 Q3","e":"afrm","d":"2022-05-12","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael Linford","x":"With the strong growth of our business and continued momentum, we are raising our outlook for fiscal year '22, which I'll discuss more in a moment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/13/affirm-holdings-inc-afrm-q3-2022-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AFRM 2022 Q4","e":"afrm","d":"2022-08-25","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Michael Linford","x":"And then interest-bearing, I'll just note that some of our strongest and most profitable programs are direct-to-consumer interest-bearing products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/26/affirm-holdings-inc-afrm-q4-2022-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AFRM 2022 Q4","e":"afrm","d":"2022-08-25","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Michael Linford","x":"That being said, our direct-to-consumer product is much higher than that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/26/affirm-holdings-inc-afrm-q4-2022-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AFRM 2023 Q1","e":"afrm","d":"2022-11-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Max Levchin","x":"And at some point, one does pass the cost on to their customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/08/affirm-holdings-inc-afrm-q1-2023-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AFRM 2023 Q2","e":"afrm","d":"2023-02-08","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Max Levchin","x":"…savings on to the consumer and attract them this way, obviously, works really well for folks with direct-to-consumer brands where maybe manufacturing is partially owned or fully owned. And in other situations where the brand is already paying us minimal possible and is unable to shoulder any more","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/08/affirm-afrm-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2023 Q2","e":"afrm","d":"2023-02-08","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Michael Linford","x":"I think it's important to note that our direct-to-consumer channel where we have complete control, it's probably the best inside into where the structural economics are here, and that's our most profitable product and channel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/08/affirm-afrm-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2023 Q2","e":"afrm","d":"2023-02-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Max Levchin","x":"So the conversation isn't just, hey, we need to raise prices on consumers or you need to pay us more MDR.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/08/affirm-afrm-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2023 Q2","e":"afrm","d":"2023-02-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Dan Perlin","x":"And you just -- you obviously just did a very large reduction in force here.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/08/affirm-afrm-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2023 Q2","e":"afrm","d":"2023-02-08","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Jason Kupferberg","x":"But just wanted to take your temperature on how much of the lower outlook on the volume is that versus other factors, whether it be competition or just some tightening of the credit box.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/08/affirm-afrm-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2023 Q3","e":"afrm","d":"2023-05-09","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Michael Linford","x":"And part of the reason why we've seen the acceleration in our direct-to-consumer business is because of how we've been operating it, frankly, since we've been able to get that moved first ahead of any, sort of merchant interaction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/09/affirm-afrm-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2023 Q3","e":"afrm","d":"2023-05-09","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Michael Linford","x":"One is, it will look more like our direct-to-consumer product that we have today just looks like an installment loan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/09/affirm-afrm-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2023 Q3","e":"afrm","d":"2023-05-09","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Michael Linford","x":"We also had a real acceleration in our direct-to-consumer business, which is obviously away from merchants like Amazon.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/09/affirm-afrm-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2023 Q3","e":"afrm","d":"2023-05-09","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Michael Linford","x":"We mentioned our strength in direct-to-consumer, our guidance definitely points to that trend continuing where we also have strength in some of our largest partnerships that are either accelerating or still growing at very, very fast clips.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/09/affirm-afrm-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2023 Q4","e":"afrm","d":"2023-08-24","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Michael Linford","x":"And yet, on the other side, we do have a lot of upside in our direct-to-consumer business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/25/affirm-afrm-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2023 Q4","e":"afrm","d":"2023-08-24","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Michael Linford","x":"And then, on the margin point, as we outlined in the letter, we're actually not starting from zero with the direct-to-consumer business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/25/affirm-afrm-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2023 Q4","e":"afrm","d":"2023-08-24","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Michael Linford","x":"That's one of our most profitable products because it is direct to consumer and we own the whole experience, and that really does give us a lot of advantages.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/25/affirm-afrm-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2023 Q4","e":"afrm","d":"2023-08-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Linford","x":"And then, with respect to operating expenses, we do expect the full-year benefit of the restructuring actions that we took earlier this year, enabling us to deliver what we think will be a profitable year on an adjusted operating income basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/25/affirm-afrm-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2024 Q1","e":"afrm","d":"2023-11-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Max Levchin","x":"If the merchant is very focused on their own bottom line, we're very comfortable working with them to reduce or to drive their MDRs down to make sure that their costs are under huge degree of control and passing the cost on to the consumer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/08/affirm-afrm-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2024 Q1","e":"afrm","d":"2023-11-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael Linford","x":"I think due to our outperformance, we did raise the outlook for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/08/affirm-afrm-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2024 Q2","e":"afrm","d":"2024-02-08","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Dan Dolev","x":"You're, you know, increasing the guide by 1 billion for GMV, like, you sound very upbeat about the macro.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/08/affirm-afrm-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2024 Q3","e":"afrm","d":"2024-05-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Max Levchin","x":"So that's not a short-term cost saving.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/08/affirm-afrm-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2025 Q2","e":"afrm","d":"2025-02-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Max Levchin","x":"The thing that's really worth highlighting here that's maybe sort of doesn't meet the eye immediately, we now have a very sizable audience that is direct-to-consumer in our app and with our card.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/07/affirm-afrm-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2025 Q2","e":"afrm","d":"2025-02-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Max Levchin","x":"We were actually quite focused on increasing our active consumers and it's gratifying to see the results compound, probably, the most impactful project, in that effort were our focus on direct-to-consumer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/07/affirm-afrm-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2025 Q2","e":"afrm","d":"2025-02-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Max Levchin","x":"Things like tariffs are super hard to predict, but they tend to have inflationary impact on the economy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/07/affirm-afrm-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2025 Q2","e":"afrm","d":"2025-02-06","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Vincent Caintic","x":"You know, it seems like every day we get some new macro or political news to think about, whether, you know, it's the CFEB director departure or tariffs or interest rates were higher for longer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/07/affirm-afrm-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2026 Q2","e":"afrm","d":"2026-02-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Adam Frisch","x":"On the mix between long-term and short-term and the potential to raise prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/affirm-afrm-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2026 Q3","e":"afrm","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Max Levchin","x":"We are not planning AI-related layoffs, full stop.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/affirm-afrm-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2026 Q3","e":"afrm","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Dan Dolev","x":"I just wanted to ask really quickly, some of your competitors have done some significant layoffs because of AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/affirm-afrm-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2026 Q4","e":"afrm","d":"2026-08-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Max Levchin","x":"And then really on the direct-to-consumer side, we actually see a much higher proportion of interest-bearing loans within that product set.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/31/affirm-afrm-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AFRM 2026 Q4","e":"afrm","d":"2026-08-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Max Levchin","x":"So we're running sort of north of 80% in